{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-1", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "工作與時日", "storyInfo": "舉辦文物交換儀式的地點與時間尚未確定。在當地理事官里底婭的安排下，緹緹來到第一神殿重建現場參觀。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g11_firsttemple_indoor", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$loneliness_intro", "key": "$loneliness_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉小姐，我又夢到了當初在游擊隊裡的事。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 13, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是您這個月第三次拜訪恩底彌翁神殿找我解讀夢境了，墨格斯先生。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您夢到的……仍是七年前的那個夜晚？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的……", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那個漆黑的夜晚，我們躲在樹林裡。薩爾貢人就堵在樹林外，尋找我們的蹤跡。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們不能出聲，更不能點燈，只能摸黑將手裡的武器拆開。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "螺帽、彈簧、源石元件……我把施術單元的配件一個個地繫到衣服和鞋子上，偽裝成裝飾品。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "恐懼令我渾身發冷，連源石元件劃破手掌都毫無知覺，還以為手心裡是汗水。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "天亮了，我們裝成附近村莊的伐木工，從薩爾貢人面前走過。要是暴露了，我們十幾個人都會死……", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他們面無表情地一個一個掃視我們。有一瞬間，我以為他們發現了破綻，驚慌之下被樹根絆了一跤，摔進泥地。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薩爾貢人哈哈大笑，說了一些像是嘲諷的話，用刀柄砸了我肩膀。但我很高興，我知道我們安全了。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "最近這件事反覆出現在我的夢裡，您說……", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您想知道，這是否是個神諭？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉小姐，去年在中央廣場上，我親眼見過英雄藉您的聲音開口，宣讀他們的意志。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您是米諾斯眾英雄的代言者，也是雅賽努斯城中唯一能區分普通夢境與神諭的祭司。", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果神諭為我指引的道路是再次拿起武器，那……即便我再恐懼……", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "請坐下來，先生，您的腿在顫抖，臉色也很不好。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "米諾斯的英雄不會迫使一位飽受戰爭痛苦的子民，回到他的惡夢之中。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1"}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您的意思是……？", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想，您誤讀了神諭。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "智慧與勇氣代替緊閉雙眼的雙月，照拂您和同伴，讓你們在天亮時分脫困；您也從夢中醒來，迎接雅賽努斯美好的清晨……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "英雄般的美德本該得到嘉許，但七年來瀰久不散的痛苦，讓您忽略了命運的枝頭已經結出甘美的果實……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "摘下它，先生，接受眾英雄對您的賜福。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#7$1"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "賜福……對我這樣普通的米諾斯人？", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們的神明與英雄，原本亦是普通的米諾斯人。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "感謝您，尊敬的卡珊卓拉小姐，我有點明白了……", "name": "頹喪的男人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2081_1#1$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$path_intro", "key": "$path_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡珊卓拉小姐，我來接替您的班。", "name": "助理祭司"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，原來已經這個時間了。今天來拜訪神殿的客人很多。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "最近您既要顧及恩底彌翁神殿的訪客，又因為克瑞斯拉第一神殿主管祭司空缺，要為其代行文書工作……但您的時間和精力是有限的。", "name": "助理祭司"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不用擔心我，芙里歐。解讀神諭、代神之口……是我天生的職責。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "正因如此，您應該比我更清楚，那位先生做的只是普通的夢，那不是神諭，根據哥倫比亞的說法——", "name": "助理祭司"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他可能患有創傷後壓力症候群，我知道。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那您為什麼不直接告訴他……", "name": "助理祭司"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "領受神諭對每個米諾斯人來說都是值得驕傲的事，而他的眼神卻充滿愧疚和驚懼。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#9$1"}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他希望得到神的指引，卻又害怕那個惡夢真的是無法違抗的神諭。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#9$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若他相信我解讀出的隻言片語，勝過相信自己，那我必須承擔責任，至少讓他過得輕鬆一點。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "助理祭司"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1"}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "隨後我會送他一些安神的花草茶，聯絡醫生注意他的情況。", "name": "助理祭司"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您下午不是例行休假嗎？請不要再為神殿的事操心了，去處理您的私事吧。", "name": "助理祭司"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2085_1#1$1"}, {"id": 85, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你總是在為我分憂，謝謝你，芙里歐。", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1"}, {"id": 87, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g4_athenusstreet", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$normal_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真是抱歉，赫卡德墨先生。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我一到旅店就昏過去了，沒想到睡了整整三個小時，害您在樓下等了那麼久……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "千萬不要掛心，梅捷緹克緹小姐，等候也是理事官執筆人的工作之一。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您看起來還是有點虛弱……真的要現在就去參觀第一神殿重建現場嗎？再休息一下也沒問題的。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那怎麼可以？如果說現在有什麼能讓我迅速恢復狀態，那就非克瑞斯拉第一神殿莫屬了！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "據說神殿的原址，正是米諾斯的建國英雄克瑞斯拉在群山中初次得到神諭的地方。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她在那裡建造的第一座神殿，也成了米諾斯的發源。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薩爾貢人……侵占米諾斯後，將三座城邦改建為移動城市，受到戰火侵害的克瑞斯拉第一神殿卻被留在了原址。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒想到時隔百年，雅賽努斯人決定重建這座神殿，我也因此有幸見到這座歷史遺蹟最初的風貌，真是令人期待！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您對米諾斯的歷史倒是很瞭解……也少見地誠實。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可惜，原本的第一神殿的圖紙已不幸佚失，即便重建仍無法完全還原它過去的風貌。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1"}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過他們建造神殿的風格，倒是蠻有“古風”的。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "古風？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“重振米諾斯的精神，就需要效仿雅賽努斯的建城英雄們，自主建造神殿。”", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那位倡議人在全民投票前，用這句話打動了所有人，重建神殿的議題近乎全數通過。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不需要詳細的工程規劃，不用確定人員安排，民眾的熱情和米諾斯人骨子裡對英雄的崇拜，會築成最完美的克瑞斯拉第一神殿。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 129, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早就聽說米諾斯人做事隨心隨性，但就是這份隨性讓他們取得了輝煌的藝術成就……果然如此！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多謝讚美，但願神殿能儘早完工……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1"}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "仿古重建……有意思！赫卡德墨先生，那位提出神殿重建的倡議人，想必是位心懷大志又極得民心的英雄人物吧？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃，要怎麼形容那位豐蹄小姐呢……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（喂，他怎麼思考那麼久，難道是你問了什麼不該問的？）", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（就算是這樣，赫卡德墨先生看起來很和善，應該也不會計較的，米諾斯人愛好詩歌，說不定是在斟酌措辭。）", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那個……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "再給我三秒鐘，梅捷緹克緹小姐。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好、好的。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "赫卡德墨", "content": "……三，二，一……"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "赫卡德墨", "content": "好！"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您想好了？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，五點整了，我該下班了。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梅捷緹克緹小姐，您的問題等我明天上班後再為您解答，祝您參觀愉快。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但……我們甚至還沒走到第一神殿啊？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喏，看到那堆鷹架了沒？這條大街離神殿正門就只剩下幾步路，麻煩您自行前往吧。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等——", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，我看到了熟人，他正在等我過去喝酒呢。那個傢伙的脾氣太差，要是遲到我就完蛋了，再見！", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1"}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "0,0", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咳，我剛好還在苦惱，要是理事官的執筆人只帶我看一些標準景點，回去沒有談資的話該怎麼辦呢？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你還蠻會幫別人打圓場的嘛！", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這個黎博利小子看起來畢恭畢敬，把他晾在旁邊三個小時都不生氣，沒想到是他找到機會上班摸魚！", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好啦，別抱怨了。反正時間還早，我們先在附近多逛一下。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 191, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這裡是英雄之鄉耶，說不定我們能一腳踏進哪位英雄的敘事詩裡哦？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 193, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我看出來了，你就是為了冒險才願意出差的！", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，當初我離開大巴扎，就是想找個有錢人養老才挑上了你，誰知道你是個不安分的麻煩鬼……", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#4$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹！別到處亂跑，等等我啊！", "name": "米奧"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g7_firsttemple", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$farce_intro", "key": "$farce_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "終於抓到你了！", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "duration": 1.0, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "duration": 1.0, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g11_firsttemple_indoor", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "200,0", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 1.0, "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "200,0", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 1.0, "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "離我遠一點。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼，故意疏遠祭司學院的同學？我們在題羅斯神殿一起參加辯論大賽的時候，你的表情可是比現在熱情多了。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你的聲音，太吵。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1"}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看來你已經知道我是來找你辯論的了？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#7$1"}, {"id": 254, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心吧，要是你辯論輸了，我會驕傲地用這副嗓子和這個喇叭，把你的敗績用標準的六音步編成詩歌傳頌出去的。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "再說了，“狂響的聲筒”這個名號不就是你幫我取的嗎？作為回禮，我也幫你取了一個——", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 257, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“善辯的石頭”！“狂響的聲筒”！", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "太好了，你們這對雅賽努斯城的曠世辯才都在，我們有救了！", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "快點跟我走吧，蘋果果農正在神殿裡大吵大鬧，一直說神殿工人故意拖延採石材的時間，不讓蘋果曬到太陽，想毀掉今年的收成。", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 265, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等，帕拉斯小姐呢？雖然神殿是民眾自主修建的，但她是重建神殿的第一倡議人，發生糾紛時你們不是都會找她處理嗎？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1"}, {"id": 270, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別提了，帕拉斯小姐最近忙得不可開交，昨天晚上就不見了，說不定又被誰叫去了。", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，一開始大家聽說自主修建神殿的事，都想效仿英雄參與重建，有空的就多做一點事，有事了就暫時離開。", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "誰能想到現在變得這麼混亂，還耽誤了移動城市開往日照區的時間。", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "兩位青年才俊幫幫忙，各代表一方幫我們辯論出一個解決辦法吧……最起碼辯出個輸贏也好啊！", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 277, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒想到我們兩個站在一起，就會自動讓人聯想到辯論……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 282, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以我都說了——離我遠一點，小聲一點。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 284, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "硬石頭，別仗著自己腦筋轉得快，說話就這麼跳躍哦，誰知道你是這個意思！", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1"}, {"id": 286, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不對啊，本來我就是嘴癢想找你辯論，這不就剛剛好嗎？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 288, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我還有事。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "認識這麼多年，你還是用這個藉口。這般平庸的口才，真不知道你當初是怎麼拿到辯論冠軍的。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 293, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多謝你。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1"}, {"id": 295, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……別想用激將法蒙混過關。這幾年你一聽到我提辯論就跑，別忘了，我們還差一場比賽沒有完成。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "快點，你想代表果農還是神殿工人？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "認識這麼多年，你應該也知道我不會說謊。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#8$1"}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉……我要去新建的感染者辦事處拿藥，現在可以讓開了嗎？", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 304, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "治療礦石病的藥？他不是上週三剛領過……病情怎麼發展得這麼快？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 311, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不行，我得確認一下。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 312, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喂！怎麼都走了啊！", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 319, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那群蘋果果農和我們的人都快打起來了，現在還能找誰解決問題啊，總不能大街上隨便拉一個看得順眼的人過來吧！", "name": "清醒的工匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 320, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哇，米奧你看，神殿裡好熱鬧！看來雅賽努斯民眾重建第一神殿的熱情真是十分高漲呢，害我也好想參與一下哦！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 328, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸，那邊的工匠先生，您是不是在找人幫忙呢？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 330, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}